flowchart LR

%% ==============================
%% FRONTEND LAYER
%% ==============================
FE[Frontend Layer<br/>React Dashboard] --> API((API Gateway<br/>REST APIs))

%% ==============================
%% SERVICE LAYER
%% ==============================

API --> AUTH[Authentication Service<br/>JWT / Login]
API --> SCORE[Scoring Service<br/>Upload & Trigger ML]
API --> DASH[Dashboard Service<br/>Drift Visualizations]
API --> HIST[History Service<br/>Batch Tracking]
API --> SEARCH[Analytics Service<br/>Trend Analysis]

%% ==============================
%% ML PIPELINE (CORE PROCESSING)
%% ==============================

SCORE --> PREP[Preprocessing Service<br/>Text Cleaning]
PREP --> NGRAM[Feature Extraction<br/>Character N-gram]
NGRAM --> PCA[PCA Reduction]
PCA --> IF[Isolation Forest Model]
IF --> DRIFT[Drift Aggregation Engine]

%% ==============================
%% DATABASE LAYER
%% ==============================

DRIFT --> DB[(Relational DB<br/>PostgreSQL<br/>Drift Metrics)]
HIST --> DB
DASH --> DB

%% ==============================
%% CACHE LAYER
%% ==============================

DASH --> CACHE[(Cache Layer<br/>Redis<br/>Trend Data)]

%% ==============================
%% ANALYTICS STORAGE
%% ==============================

SEARCH --> ANALYTICS[(Analytics Store<br/>Aggregated Metrics)]

%% ==============================
%% NOTIFICATION / ALERTS
%% ==============================

DRIFT --> ALERT[Alert Service<br/>Threshold Monitoring]
ALERT --> NOTIF[Notification Service<br/>Email / Slack]

%% ==============================
%% FINAL OUTPUT
%% ==============================

DASH --> USER[User Dashboard View]